    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>t</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal _______. to"
  },
