  "correct_answer": "385",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Now finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>55</mn></math></p><p>Finding<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>385</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>385</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>385</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
